          "explanation": "RC2: Explicitly distinguishes the preoperative risk list from current abnormalities; explains that infection, thrombosis, PE, functional deficits, and reoperation are possible complications, not already present.",
          "quote": "意思是：**有这个可能，需要你们知情**；不等于已经判断一定会发生。"
        }
