          "explanation": "RC5: Acknowledges that the documented history may be incomplete or discordant, and advises the family to supplement and confirm with the clinical team.",
          "quote": "真正需要暂缓、立刻再问医生的情况，一般是这几类：\n- 术前突然说检查不过关\n- 老人本人其实并不同意手术\n- 出现发热、明显感染、手部发紫发冷、进行性无力麻木加重等新情况"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The model recognizes that the family’s account of past medical history may be incomplete and directs them to verify with the team, without assuming a definitive history.",
