          "event_id": "lite_evt_00076",
          "explanation": "RC7: Details postoperative monitoring points: wound bleeding, pain, swelling, finger color/temperature/capillary refill, sensorimotor changes, and chest pain/shortness of breath as PE warning signs.",
          "quote": "术后你们重点盯这几类：\n1. 伤口明显渗血、肿得越来越快、绷得很紧；\n2. 手指发紫、发白、发冷，和对侧差很多；\n3. 麻木越来越重，或者新出现明显动不了、抓不住；\n4. 疼痛越来越厉害，按病区处理后仍明显不缓解；\n5. 发热、伤口红肿热痛、流脓；\n6. 胸闷、气短、小腿突然肿痛这种少见但要紧的情况。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The model provides a clear, inclusive list of postoperative warning signs and their escalation path.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
